      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Swer">Swer</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On ðone Drihten, ic eom unscyldig ægðer ge dæde ge dihtes æt þære tihtlan, ðe N. me tihð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[I swear] by the Lord [that] I am not guilty of the accusation that N. laid against me, either in deed or purpose.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðæs oðres að, þæt he is unscyldi. On ðone Drihten, ic eom unscyldig ægðer ge dæde ge dihtes æt ðere tihtlan, ðe Ñ me tihð.</ab>
      </div>
